#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Active: {managers}. These tools may also change power modes or charge "
"limits. Review their settings if your choices do not stay applied."
msgstr "正在运行：{managers}。这些工具也可能更改电源模式或充电上限。如果设置未能保持，请检查这些工具的设置。"

#: src/diagnostics.rs:49
msgid ""
"Service status could not be inspected. This can happen in a sandbox or on "
"systems without systemd."
msgstr "无法检查服务状态。在沙盒环境或没有 systemd 的系统上可能出现此情况。"

